# Task 3 – IoT Data Monitoring Dashboard

## Objective

To create a dashboard for real-time monitoring of industrial environmental parameters.

## Features

* Temperature Monitoring
* Humidity Monitoring
* Gas Level Monitoring
* Alert Display
* Real-Time Updates

## Dashboard Parameters

* Temperature (°C)
* Humidity (%)
* Gas Sensor Reading
* Alert Status

## Output

The dashboard displays live sensor values and alerts users when abnormal conditions are detected.
